      "en": "Praise the LORD! Praise the LORD, my soul.",
      "ko": "할렐루야 내 영혼아 여호와를 찬양하라",
      "source_text_hash": "a83ccab12eb1a7aeb53722223c10df370693a271ae2d7ea3c64e5a2e964cacad",
      "translation_text_hash": "e5abdca7b543452aef293981463901c8edd9da7f1f146d1191448ca2e4f3ed88",
