      "en": "Don’t put your trust in princes, in a son of man in whom there is no help.",
      "ko": "방백들을 의지하지 말며 도울 힘이 없는 인생도 의지하지 말찌니",
      "source_text_hash": "9c392ef748d2222eac3a3616c032590b0b1d35e4c5c1d311118f8e9955c15173",
      "translation_text_hash": "83c111d0f975aa15b4c6db8520e2df5951432d56eef7d29635e2495efe5a59ac",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
