      "en": "His spirit departs, and he returns to the earth. In that very day, his thoughts perish.",
      "ko": "그 호흡이 끊어지면 흙으로 돌아가서 당일에 그 도모가 소멸하리로다",
      "source_text_hash": "288bd2da3abb78aeb6197365b60043bdbac818e9a9edf2df9ddd3c363b361349",
      "translation_text_hash": "9c94e091c51c58f1e5c61ca4654770dd0aa62d412d6b53f85e258a0772a52ec6",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
